<Fragment>
  <Process Name="proc_110_LowerTray" BeginStepID="6" Category="40 TaskSequence Processes (BatterySwapTruck)" Description="**Purpose:** Completes the battery swap operation by lowering the truck's tray, re-enabling physics and battery calculations, and resuming the truck's movement so it can continue operations.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;**Steps:**&#xD;&#xA;**TaskDuration** (Delay) - Delay for task duration&#xD;&#xA;**LowerTray** (Fire) - Fire truck's `event_SymbolUpdate_LowerTray`&#xD;&#xA;**SpeedUpdatesTrue** (Fire) - Fire truck's `event_SpeedUpdates_True`&#xD;&#xA;**BatteryUpdatesTrue** (Fire) - Fire truck's `event_BatteryUpdates_True`&#xD;&#xA;**Movement** (Resume) - Resume movement of truck object&#xD;&#xA;">
